{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.avif?t=1759960774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras_big/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.webp?t=1759960774 width=1560 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a life of sun, sand, and dreams in <strong>Beach Life Simulator</strong>! Developed by a solo creator, this game is inspired by the vibrant beaches of Brazil, featuring detailed visuals powered by Unreal Engine, cultural references, and playful national memes \u2014 all with a focus on creativity, fun, and an authentically Brazilian vibe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied gameplay</strong>: Start with simple jobs like street vendor, kiosk attendant, or supermarket worker, and grow your career by unlocking new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social life &amp; leisure</strong>: Play street soccer, basketball, meet friends, or simply relax by the seaside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic world</strong>: Explore living environments with weather, natural lighting, and details that create an immersive tropical atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brazilian style</strong>: Cultural references and light-hearted humor bring authenticity to the experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin small with simple jobs such as street vendor, kiosk attendant, or market employee.<br>As you progress, aim higher \u2014 perhaps become a business owner and build your very own beach empire!<br>Beyond work, enjoy plenty of leisure activities: chill by the ocean, play soccer, basketball, or hang out with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Vision</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer mode</strong> is under consideration: the idea is to play together with friends, though no date is set yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous updates</strong> through devlogs (on YouTube) showcasing progress, new mechanics, visual improvements, and additional content.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068980?t=1759960774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/74a328a042089a8c094899a973cdb3b8d42dcaeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759960774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/2fe820a339f4ce4544261da22bfdffb78c44af6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759960774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/2fe820a339f4ce4544261da22bfdffb78c44af6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759960774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There may be mention of drugs, alcohol and also some acts of robbery or theft."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_